# Model 2 — experiment outputs (raw per-job CSVs are regenerable from the cluster)
# Ignore everything under results/ EXCEPT the derived analysis artifacts:
#   - intra-summary.csv / inter-summary.csv (analyze.py)
#   - per-cell cell.json metadata (+ folded "derived" stats)
#   - figures/ (plots/plot_all.py -> PNG + PDF)
# The !results/**/ line is required so git descends into the ignored tree.
results/**
!results/**/
!results/**/*-summary.csv
!results/**/cell.json
!results/**/figures/**
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# rendered manifests are regenerable via manifests/template/render.py --all
manifests/namespace.yaml
manifests/intra/
manifests/inter/
